194
00:11:13,430 --> 00:11:18,030
To start, let me restate the objective of this initiative in plain terms.

195
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:24,270
We are launching a controlled business rollout designed to test value, operational readiness,

196
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:28,830
