197
00:11:28,830 --> 00:11:30,630
This is not about perfection.

198
00:11:30,630 --> 00:11:33,070
It's about learning quickly and safely.

199
00:11:33,070 --> 00:11:34,070
Exactly.

200
00:11:34,070 --> 00:11:36,870
And I think it's important we emphasize that mindset.

201
00:11:36,870 --> 00:11:40,590
Some teams still approach this as if it were a full-scale launch.

202
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:45,550
