224
00:12:58,050 --> 00:13:02,610
The expectation is not that nothing goes wrong, but that issues are detected early

225
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:04,690
and communicated immediately.

226
00:13:04,690 --> 00:13:06,570
Communication is key there.

227
00:13:06,570 --> 00:13:09,930
If an issue is found, even if it's still under investigation,

228
00:13:09,930 --> 00:13:12,210
