237
00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:36,210
Overpromising now would create unnecessary pressure on support and damaged trust.

238
00:13:36,210 --> 00:13:41,130
A calm, confident, and honest tone will attract the right early users.

239
00:13:41,130 --> 00:13:44,610
And internally, marketing also sets the narrative.

240
00:13:44,610 --> 00:13:50,410
