241
00:13:50,410 --> 00:13:53,130
That's why alignment meetings like this matter.

242
00:13:53,130 --> 00:13:54,130
Absolutely.

243
00:13:54,130 --> 00:13:58,490
Speaking of sales, their role during the pilot is selective engagement.

244
00:13:58,490 --> 00:14:00,010
We are not pushing volume.

245
00:14:00,010 --> 00:14:05,130
